 "assumptions": [
  "ms-gmsdc = gmsd::ms_gmsdc_rgb8 -> ms_gmsd::run, returns .1 (gamma*ms + (1-gamma)*0.01*chroma) \u2014 the chroma-fused score (lib.rs:532-546). Same pipeline work as ms-gmsd.",
  "Level 0 streamed (ms_gmsd.rs:284-475): per px per img fill_row RGB->YIQ f64 (3 cvt + 3x(3mul+2add) + 3 store); similarity_row (ms_gmsd.rs:503-530, chroma_prewitt! chroma_gradient.rs:4-18): per px two Prewitt magnitudes on Y (each: 8 taps -> 12 mul + 10 add + mul2 add1 sqrt1 = mul14 add11 sqrt1), then q = ((2*r*d - 0.5*r*d) + c)/((r^2+d^2 - 0.5*r*d) + c): mul6 add5 div1; 1 store.",
  "Level 0 also emits level-1 planes: half_row 2x2 average per out elem: 3 add + 1 mul + 4 load + 1 store on 6 planes.",
  "Levels 1-3: map() similarity on level dims (elements W_l*H_l) + variance fold; half() between levels on all 6 planes.",
  "variance (ms_gmsd.rs:646-675): 2 passes of fold_map: pass1 add1+load1 per elem; pass2 (v-mean)^2: sub+fma+load per elem.",
  "finish (ms_gmsd.rs:677-692): 4-var weighted sqrt + joint I/Q RMSE on level-3 planes: per elem sub2 fma2 load2 -> chroma rms; gamma = 2/(1+0.32*exp(-15*ms)) - 1 (exp1 + ~5 ops once); score = gamma*ms + (1-gamma)*0.01*chroma.",
  "Halo: Prewitt 3x3 radius 1 at each level (scale 2^l); the l0 stream pads planes by 1 (padded_pitch)."
 ],
